From 800d67ee8407b23107f9e8c4b273388e5b1debfe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gili Tzabari <cowwoc2020@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 03:57:10 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Correct the Darwin V8 unsigned pointer format

The existing codex_pointer_formats_test fails with exit 6 on native macOS ARM in Actions run 38695233250, job 116290142838. V8PRIuPTR expands to lxu, printing hexadecimal followed by a literal u. Use lu to preserve unsigned decimal output.

Regression: compile the existing real-header fixture with Clang 23.1.2 and a preincluded v8config.h followed by V8_OS_DARWIN=1 on Linux. The preceding header exits 6; the corrected header exits 0 with -Werror. The normal Linux header fixture also exits 0. This branch probe does not replace native Darwin acceptance.

Base: rust-v0.162.1 (092d3acd6bec3e3a14bdc7e7a2810ab628ab759d), with preceding issue-61 patches. Tracking: https://github.com/holdmyspot-com/codex-unleashed/issues/61
---
 patches/v8_clang_mingw_detection.patch | 12 +++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/patches/v8_clang_mingw_detection.patch b/patches/v8_clang_mingw_detection.patch
index 5d4e3fe3a..7ffd4db64 100644
--- a/patches/v8_clang_mingw_detection.patch
+++ b/patches/v8_clang_mingw_detection.patch
@@ -10,3 +10,4 @@ Subject: [PATCH] Recognize Clang MinGW and verify pointer formats with real
  test/codex/pointer-formats-test.cc | 28 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
- 3 files changed, 58 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)
+ src/base/macros.h                 |  2 +-
+ 4 files changed, 59 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)
  create mode 100644 test/codex/pointer-formats-test.cc
@@ -109 +110,10 @@ index 0000000..c49e072
 +}
+diff --git a/orig/v8-15.0.245.2/src/base/macros.h b/mod/v8-15.0.245.2/src/base/macros.h
+index 4355dec..a61a2ab 100644
+--- a/orig/v8-15.0.245.2/src/base/macros.h
++++ b/mod/v8-15.0.245.2/src/base/macros.h
+@@ -403,3 +403,3 @@ V8_INLINE A implicit_cast(A x) {
+ #undef V8PRIuPTR
+-#define V8PRIuPTR "lxu"
++#define V8PRIuPTR "lu"
+ #endif
